302+  01CC              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
303+  01CC              ; Resident command-dispatch entry, one bounded unit of work.
304+  01CC              ; OUT: carry clear/Z=1/A=0 when no command is pending;
305+  01CC              ;      carry clear/Z=0 with HL=#C000, BC=size on a valid E0h frame;
306+  01CC              ;      carry set/A=status for a rejected command or receive failure.
307+  01CC              ; The caller owns the resident main loop and must keep its stack/code outside
308+  01CC              ; WIN3. E0h is consumed from ZXCMD while CBIT stays asserted until DMA is armed.
309+  01CC              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
310+  01CC              P126_NGS_ZXCMD       EQU #01
